    <section id="osn-explore" aria-labelledby="osn-explore-title" class="py-[clamp(56px,7vw,88px)] border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1140px] mx-auto px-7">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[821px]:grid-cols-2 gap-10 min-[821px]:gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="{{ eyebrow }}"><i class="w-[9px] h-[9px] flex-none bg-[var(--acc)] [clip-path:polygon(50%_0,100%_50%,50%_100%,0_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>Explore further</p>
          <h2 id="osn-explore-title" class="{{ display }}">See the network <span class="corn-text">in action.</span></h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-[1.02rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[44rem]">There's a great deal more of it than fits here, including pilot servers with your own branding and onboarding.</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="border-y border-ink/15 divide-y divide-ink/15" aria-label="Explore the Open Science Network">
          <a class="group flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between gap-5 py-5 font-disp font-[620] text-[1.08rem] text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:text-ink focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-spark" href="https://openscience.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Visit openscience.network</span><span class="text-spark transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          <a class="group flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between gap-5 py-5 font-disp font-[620] text-[1.08rem] text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:text-ink focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-spark" href="https://sandbox.openscience.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Try the sandbox</span><span class="text-spark transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
          {# <a class="group flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between gap-5 py-5 font-disp font-[620] text-[1.08rem] text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:text-ink focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-spark" href="/oscars">
            <span>Read the OSCARS proposal</span><span class="text-spark transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>#}
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# ---------- co-design & research ---------- #}
    <section id="codesign" class="py-[clamp(56px,7vw,96px)] border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1140px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }}"><i class="w-[9px] h-[9px] flex-none bg-[var(--acc)] [clip-path:polygon(50%_0,100%_50%,50%_100%,0_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>Co-design &amp; research</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }}">Build on it, <span class="corn-text">or study it.</span></h2>

      <blockquote class="mt-9 border-l-2 border-[var(--acc)] pl-[22px] max-w-[52rem]">
        <p class="font-disp font-normal text-[clamp(1.15rem,2.2vw,1.6rem)] leading-[1.28] text-ink">“We're not just piloting a platform, we're piloting the process.”</p>
        <footer class="mt-3 font-smono text-[.7rem] tracking-[.06em] text-ink-3">Warwick Methods Fellowship · <span class="text-corn-2">A Living Lab for the Federated Research Commons</span></footer>
      </blockquote>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[821px]:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 mt-9">
        <div class="{{ cell }}">
          <h3 class="{{ cellh }} !mt-0">Co-design and extend</h3>
          <p class="{{ cellp }}">Because it's modular the whole way down, an intervention can ship as an extension and run on a live server without forking the app, in hours rather than months. A collaboration can take whatever shape suits: a grant, a consortium, a fellowship, or our co-design programme <a class="text-spark hover:underline" href="/mosaic">Mosaic</a>.</p>
          <div class="mt-3"><a class="{{ cardlink }}" href="/posts/safer-social-networking-bonfire-s-recent-experiment-with-prosocial-design-patterns/">One we built in an afternoon <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ cell }}">
          <h3 class="{{ cellh }} !mt-0">Study the mechanisms</h3>
          <p class="{{ cellp }}">Governance, moderation and decision processes are all explicit and adjustable, in real communities rather than lab conditions. You can change the thing you're studying, not only observe it, and because servers federate you can study how communities behave across institutions. For example: CrowCards, designed with Princeton for documenting how a community governs itself.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1 mt-3">
            <a class="{{ cardlink }}" href="http://crowcards.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CrowCards<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="{{ cardlink }}" href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3772318.3790855" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CHI 2026 paper <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="{{ cell }}">
          <h3 class="{{ cellh }} !mt-0">Contribute to the commons</h3>
          <p class="{{ cellp }}">Whatever we build together is free software under the AGPL: yours to run and fork long after the funding ends, and everyone else's to build on. What one community funds, every community inherits.</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1 mt-3">
            <a class="{{ cardlink }}" href="/extensions">Browse the extensions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a class="{{ cardlink }}" href="https://github.com/bonfire-networks" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Browse the sources <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a class="{{ more }}" href="/contact">Talk to us about a collaboration →</a>
    </div></section>

    {# ---------- voices ---------- #}
    <section id="voices" class="py-[clamp(56px,7vw,96px)] border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1140px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }}"><i class="w-[9px] h-[9px] flex-none bg-[var(--acc)] [clip-path:polygon(50%_0,100%_50%,50%_100%,0_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>What researchers say</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }}">Some of the <span class="corn-text">scholars driving it.</span></h2>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 min-[821px]:grid-cols-2 gap-3.5 mt-[34px]">
        {%- for v in voices %}
        <figure class="{{ cell }} m-0 flex flex-col">
          <blockquote class="flex-1"><p class="font-disp text-[1.12rem] leading-[1.42] text-ink">“{{ v.quote }}”</p></blockquote>
          <figcaption class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-ink/[0.07] flex items-start gap-3.5">
            {%- set face = v.avatar | inlineImage %}
            {% if face %}<a class="shrink-0" href="{{ v.url }}"{% if '//' in v.url %} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %} tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img class="h-11 w-11 rounded-full object-cover border border-ink/15 transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-80" src="{{ face }}" alt="" loading="lazy"></a>{% endif %}
            <span class="min-w-0">
              <a class="font-disp font-[620] text-[1.02rem] text-ink hover:text-spark" href="{{ v.url }}"{% if '//' in v.url %} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}>{{ v.who }} <span class="text-ink-2 text-[.8em]" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
              <span class="block mt-0.5 text-[.86rem] leading-snug text-ink-2">{{ v.where }}</span>
            </span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>

      <p class="mt-8 font-smono text-[.7rem] text-ink-3 max-w-[62ch] leading-[1.7]">Given to the <a class="text-spark hover:underline" href="https://openscience.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Science Network</a>, where there are more of them.</p>
    </div></section>

    {# ---------- writing & talks ---------- #}
    <section id="writing" class="py-[clamp(56px,7vw,96px)] border-t border-ink/[0.07] scroll-mt-[70px]">
    <div class="max-w-[1140px] mx-auto px-7">
      <p class="{{ eyebrow }}"><i class="w-[9px] h-[9px] flex-none bg-[var(--acc)] [clip-path:polygon(50%_0,100%_50%,50%_100%,0_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></i>Writing &amp; talks</p>
      <h2 class="{{ display }}">On <span class="corn-text">the record.</span></h2>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[1.02rem] text-ink-2 max-w-[44rem]">Papers, abstracts and articles, written by collaborators or independent observers.</p>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3.5 mt-[34px]">
        {%- for w in writing %}
        <div class="{{ cell }}">
          <h3 class="{{ cellh }} !mt-0 !mb-2"><a class="hover:text-spark" href="{{ w.url }}"{% if '//' in w.url %} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"{% endif %}>{{ w.title }}</a></h3>
          <p class="text-[.86rem] text-ink-2"><b class="font-semibold text-ink">{{ w.who }}</b> · {{ w.venue }} · {{ w.year }}</p>
          {% if w.quotes %}<blockquote class="mt-3 border-l-2 border-[var(--acc)] pl-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
            {%- for q in w.quotes %}<p class="font-disp text-[1.06rem] leading-[1.4] {{ 'text-ink' if loop.last else 'text-ink-2' }}">“{{ q }}”</p>{%- endfor %}
          </blockquote>{% endif %}
          {% if w.text %}<p class="{{ cellp }} mt-3">{{ w.text }}</p>{% endif %}
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-1 mt-4">
            <a class="{{ cardlink }}" href="{{ w.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ w.linktext }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            {% if w.url2 %}<a class="{{ cardlink }}" href="{{ w.url2 }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ w.linktext2 }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div></section>

    {# ---------- CTA ---------- #}
    <section class="text-center pt-[clamp(60px,8vw,110px)] pb-[clamp(80px,9vw,140px)] border-t border-ink/[0.07]">
    <div class="max-w-[1140px] mx-auto px-7">
      <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-[44ch] font-disp font-[560] text-[clamp(2rem,4.6vw,3.4rem)] leading-[1.05] text-balance [font-variation-settings:'opsz'_96]">Every research community deserves <span class="italic font-medium text-flame">a digital lab of its own.</span></h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3.5 mt-[34px]">
        <a class="{{ btnfire }}" href="https://openscience.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more about the Open Science Network</a>
        <a class="{{ btnline }}" href="https://sandbox.openscience.network" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Try the sandbox</a>
        <a class="{{ btnline }}" href="/contact">Start a conversation</a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-[26px] font-smono text-[.82rem] text-ink-3">Free software, no investors, no ads, no lock-in. <a class="text-spark border-b border-spark/35 pb-0.5 hover:border-spark" href="/mosaic">How co-design works.</a></p>
    </div></section>

    </main>
  </div>
</div>
